    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;Don’t miss one of the country’s fastest-rising headliners as he brings his cross-Canada Maxout Always Stand-Up Comedy Tour to Yellowknife! Come see why The Bonfire’s DJ Lou said, “Super funny...I love this guy!” and why comedians Pete Correale and Sebastian Maniscalco of The Pete Correale &amp; Sebastian Maniscalco Show called&nbsp;Mike&nbsp;“the type of guy who could...&lt;/p&gt;\\n"
